# Firmware reverse-engineering scratch space.
#
# Working notes and generated artefacts from picking apart the BES2600
# firmware patch image while chasing the JOIN refusals: disassembly, the
# radare2 scripts that produce it, and copies of the vendor blobs themselves.
# Deliberately not pushed -- the disassembly regenerates from the scripts in
# a couple of minutes, and the blobs are redistributable only from
# gitlab.com/pine64-org/bes2600-firmware, not from here.
fw-analysis/
